se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Ming and Xiao Yun are classmates, they prepare a group project. Today, the teacher lets each group share their progress. Xiao Ming is very confident in his ideas, he prepares to share at the meeting. Before the discussion starts, Xiao Yun tells Xiao Ming that she can help him share to avoid his nervousness, Xiao Ming does not speak, they look at Xiao Ming's speech together. After the meeting starts, Xiao Yun raises her hand to speak, showing her ideas to the teacher and the class leader. Xiao Ming finds that Xiao Yun's ideas are very similar to his own, and he is stunned for a while. The teacher and the class leader both affirm this idea, Xiao Yun turns her head and gives Xiao Ming a smile. Xiao Ming seems to understand.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Yun want to share ideas before Xiao Ming?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Yun accidentally thinks of the same idea as Xiao Ming.\nB. Xiao Yun wants to get the teacher's appreciation through Xiao Ming's idea.\nC. Xiao Yun worries that Xiao Ming will be nervous, so she helps him share.\nD. Xiao Yun thinks she can express this idea more clearly than Xiao Ming.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014062649010127878,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0bbd6006945d27fcf6c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367675636,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:55","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2b27bc8e160b48d68538b5